@NPCollapse spent years working on technical AI safety. Now he's stopped, "I realized even if I succeeded, I have not succeeded ... The actual problem we are facing is a political problem, not a technical problem."

As Connor tells @robertwrighter on @NonzeroPods, these are choices that should be made by the people, not private companies.

